      <p>In this regard, we respectfully request permission and formal endorsement to conduct our community immersion programs and service initiatives within your esteemed barangay for Academic Batch <strong>${l}</strong>. Our student volunteers will be engaged in the following community-building activities:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Participatory Community Needs Profiling</strong> - Household surveys to assess health, sanitation, and youth welfare priorities.</li>
